ceedings.","zh":"第 1 項－業務是我們的策略和 SBU 業務的概述，包括關鍵的財務驅動因素。可能對我們業務產生影響的其他項目在第 1A 項——風險因素和第 3 項——法律訴訟中討論。"},{"en":"Incorporated in 1981, AES is a global energy company accelerating the future of energy. Together with our many stakeholders, we are improving lives by delivering the greener, smarter energy solutions the world needs. Our diverse workforce is committed to continuous innovation and operational excellence, while partnering with our customers on their strategic energy transitions and continuing to meet their energy needs today.","zh":"AES 成立於 1981 年，是一家加速能源未來發展的全球能源公司。我們與眾多利害關係人一起，透過提供世界所需的更綠色、更智慧的能源解決方案來改善生活。我們多元化的員工致力於持續創新和卓越運營，同時與客戶合作進行策略性能源轉型，並繼續滿足他們當今的能源需求。"},{"en":"The focus of our strategy is to partner with large corporations to deliver the electricity they need when they need it. We are very well-positioned as a leading provider of renewable energy to data center companies, particularly in the U.S., and to large mining companies outside the U.S. These customers want to work with AES due to our track record of providing customized solutions that best serve their specific needs and delivering our projects on time and on budget.","zh":"我們策略的重點是與大公司合作，在他們需要時提供所需的電力。作為資料中心公司（尤其是美國的資料中心公司）以及美國以外的大型礦業公司的可再生能源領先供應商，我們處於非常有利的地位。這些客戶希望與 AES 合作，因為我們在提供最能滿足其特定需求的客製化解決方案以及按時、按預算交付我們的專案方面擁有良好的記錄。"}],"markets":[{"en":"The segment reporting structure uses the Company's management reporting structure as its foundation to reflect how the Company manages the businesses internally and is mainly organized by technology.","zh":"分部報告架構以公司的管理報告架構為基礎，反映公司內部管理業務的方式，主要依技術組織。"},{"en":"We are organized into four technology-oriented SBUs: Renewables (solar, wind, energy storage, and hydro generation facilities); Utilities (AES Indiana, AES Ohio, and AES El Salvador regulated utilities and their generation facilities); Energy Infrastructure (natural gas, LNG, coal, pet coke, diesel, and oil generation facilities); and New Energy Technologies (investments in Fluence, Maximo and other new and innovative energy technology businesses) — which are led by our SBU Presidents.","zh":"我們分為四個以技術為導向的 SBU： 可再生能源（太陽能、風能、儲能和水力發電設施）；公用事業（AES 印第安納州、AES 俄亥俄州和 AES 薩爾瓦多監管的公用事業及其發電設施）；能源基礎設施（天然氣、液化天然氣、煤炭、石油焦、柴油和石油發電設施）；新能源技術（對 Fluence、Maxence 和其他能源技術的投資）——新能源技術（對 Fluence、Maxence）領導 Fluence）。"}],"customers":[{"en":"We sell to a wide variety of customers. No individual customer accounted for 10% or more of our 2025 total revenue. In our generation business, we own and/or operate power plants to sell power to wholesale customers such as utilities and other intermediaries, as well as to large corporations. Our utilities sell to end-user customers in the residential, commercial, industrial, and governmental sectors in a defined service area.","zh":"我們向各種各樣的客戶銷售產品。沒有任何個人客戶占我們 2025 年總收入的 10% 或更高。在我們的發電業務中，我們擁有和/或經營發電廠，向批發客戶（例如公用事業公司和其他中介機構）以及大公司出售電力。我們的公用事業公司向特定服務區域內的住宅、商業、工業和政府部門的最終用戶客戶銷售產品。"},{"en":"At AES, our people are instrumental to helping us meet the world's energy needs. Supporting our people is a foundational value for AES. Our actions are grounded in the shared values that shape AES' culture: Safety First, Highest Standards, and All Together. The AES Corporation is led and managed by our Chief Executive Officer and the Global Leadership Team with the guidance and oversight of our Board of Directors. Governance and standards for AES people are guided by the Chief Human Resources Officer, with input from members of the Global Leadership Team.","zh":"在 AES，我們的員工在幫助我們滿足世界能源需求方面發揮了重要作用。支持我們的員工是 AES 的基本價值。我們的行動植根於塑造 AES 文化的共同價值觀：安全第一、最高標準和團結一致。 AES 公司由我們的執行長和全球領導團隊在董事會的指導和監督下領導和管理。 AES 人員的治理和標準由首席人力資源長指導，並聽取全球領導團隊成員的意見。"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Energy Infrastructure","val":5402000000,"zh":"能源基礎設施"},{"name":"Utilities","val":4122000000,"zh":"公用事業"},{"name":"Renewables","val":2913000000,"zh":"再生能源"},{"name":"AES Andes","val":900000000,"zh":"AES安地斯山脈"},{"name":"New Energy Technologies","val":1000000,"zh":"新能源技術"}],"total":12233000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Electricity Generation","val":8195000000,"zh":"發電"},{"name":"Nonregulatedrevenue","val":8195000000,"zh":"非管制收入"},{"name":"Electric Distribution","val":4038000000,"zh":"配電"},{"name":"Regulated Revenue","val":4038000000,"zh":"監管收入"}],"total":12233000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Total Non Us","val":7177000000,"zh":"非美國總計"},{"name":"US","val":5056000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"CL","val":1516000000,"zh":"化學發光"},{"name":"DO","val":1363000000,"zh":"做"},{"name":"SV","val":1086000000,"zh":"SV"},{"name":"MX","val":760000000,"zh":"墨西哥"},{"name":"BG","val":687000000,"zh":"BG"},{"name":"PA","val":649000000,"zh":"PA"},{"name":"CO","val":422000000,"zh":"一氧化碳"},{"name":"PR","val":404000000,"zh":"公關"}],"total":12233000000}},"peers":["EIX","CNP","CMS","ETR","AEP"]}}